node_modules
dist
coverage
.env
# Every sibling of it, not just the exact name. `scripts/e2e-compose.mjs` moves an operator's real
# deploy/.env aside to deploy/.env.before-e2e for the length of a run; a SIGKILL, a crash or
# KEEP_STACK=1 leaves that file sitting in the worktree holding SESSION_SECRET, CONNECTOR_KEY,
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD, PALOALTO_API_KEY and OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET, and `git add -A` would commit it.
.env.*
# …but the checked-in template is one of those siblings, and it is meant to be tracked.
!.env.example
# The nightly dumps: whole-database pg_dump files, written by the backup container into the
# worktree through a bind mount. Copy them off the VM (deploy/INSTALL.md, "Backup") — never commit.
deploy/backups/
*.log
.playwright-mcp
.superpowers
apps/web/src/api/schema.d.ts
.claude/worktrees
# design review screenshots
design/review/*.png
playwright-report
test-results
apps/web/e2e/.auth
